{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-137","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-137-talk-403817140-line","text":"在埃普斯的断崖底部，发狂的泰坦眷属和怪物正在你的身后紧追不舍。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-137-talk-403817141-line","text":"坍塌的堡垒将山谷拦腰截断。边缘模糊的雕刻尚能隐约看出，它曾隶属于某座信仰万径之门的城邦。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-137-talk-403817142-line","text":"你在残垣断壁中来回穿梭，试图从破碎的雕像与祭坛中找到一条通路，可石门上的巨大镜子却挡在了你的面前，「入此门者，当心怀一线希望。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-137-talk-403817143-line","text":"你来不及思考镜面的箴言，默念着雅努斯的尊名，一头扎入镜中。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-137-text-15425799155530778405-choice","text":"向嘈杂的方向游曳。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-137-text-13996721010137901253-effect","text":"使石镜获得：进入【战斗】或【事件】区域时触发","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-137-text-9708554445765081556-choice","text":"向静谧的方向游曳。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-137-text-7211136512164502972-effect","text":"使石镜获得：进入【遭遇】或【奖励】区域时触发","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-137-text-14018395641190119263-choice","text":"向有谕示的方向进行。","speaker":""}]}
